# Who has to review a change before it can be merged.
#
# This file is what turns "one approval" into "an approval FROM THE OWNER".
# Without it, a branch rule requiring a review is satisfied by any collaborator;
# with it, and with "Require review from Code Owners" turned on, every pull
# request waits for the person named here.
#
# The pattern is every file, because every file in this repository is one
# person's to answer for. A second maintainer is added by putting their handle
# on a line of its own, scoped to what they own - `/src/StateUI.Runtime/ @them`.

